        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "3 Bedroom Duplex – The Glen, Cabinteely\r\n\r\nSavills New Homes is delighted to present this beautifully designed three-bedroom duplex at The Glen, an exciting new development in the heart of Cabinteely.\r\n\r\nOffering generous and thoughtfully planned accommodation, these spacious homes have been designed with modern living in mind. The layout provides excellent separation between living and bedroom accommodation, with bright, well-proportioned interiors and a high-quality contemporary specification throughout.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen and dining area creates a fantastic space for everyday living and entertaining, complemented by a separate living area. Three generously sized bedrooms provide excellent accommodation, making these homes particularly well suited to first-time buyers, young families and those looking for additional space to work from home.\r\n\r\nEach home has been designed to maximise natural light and functionality, with excellent storage and private outdoor space adding to the overall appeal.\r\n\r\nThe Glen enjoys an excellent location in Cabinteely, with a wide range of established amenities nearby. Cabinteely Village, Cabinteely Park and Kilbogget Park are all within easy reach, while the area is well served by schools, shops, cafés and leisure facilities.\r\n\r\nExcellent transport connections provide convenient access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding employment hubs, with the N11 Quality Bus Corridor and Luas services nearby, together with easy access to the M50.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, contemporary design and a highly convenient South Dublin location, these three-bedroom duplexes offer an excellent opportunity to purchase a new home at The Glen."
      },
